
How to run python code 

1. Run the following in mac terminal 

gfortran -shared -fPIC -o gust.so uvsing.f lamp.f

python3 -m numpy.f2py -c uvsing.pyf gust.so    

(ignore these  steps it is necessary only to generate uvsing.pyf which I prepared)
#python3 -m numpy.f2py uvsing.f -m uvsing -h uvsing.pyf  
#python3 -m numpy.f2py uvsing.f -m uvsing -h --overwrite-signature uvsing.pyf

uvsing.f and lamp.f files computes the gust velocity field. uvsing.pyf is the python to fortran interface. 

2. Then run 

python calluvsing.py 

this will generate you the velocity field at global x,y,z location.  

